=== What each method was asked ===
CFA (02): does constraining this item's thresholds and loading equal across
  sex degrade global fit, measured by a score test on the constraint.
IRT (05): holding the latent trait fixed, do women and men differ in the
  probability of endorsing this item, measured by a likelihood ratio test
  against a fixed anchor set.
These are related but not the same question, and the ranking below is the
only place in this repo where that difference is visible.

